<title>USA: TABLE - Pamrapo Bancorp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Pamrapo Bancorp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BAYONNE, N.J. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.44		    $0.32</p>
<p> Net			  1,260		    1,042</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	     150			150</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,844		    3,313</p>
<p>	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.86		    $0.67</p>
<p> Net			  2,573		    2,246</p>
<p> Loan loss prov	     300			300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   2,998		    3,377</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said the substantial increase in earnings per share resulted from fewer shares in the 1997 periods compared the same periods last year.</p>
<p>Full name is Pamrapo Bancorp Inc.</p>
</text>
